2	line	Willow	Burntof likes to hang out at the Rising Sun Inn located in Falador.
2	line	Willow	Need help finding anyone else?
2	action	previous
1	option	Where can I find the entrance to the ruins?
2	line	Player	Where can I find the entrance to the ruins?
2	line	Willow	On the western side of Ice Mountain. There's no way up on this side so you'll need to head east of here first and go around the dwarf colony to get there.
2	line	Player	Okay.
2	action	previous
1	option	Nothing, thanks.
2	line	Player	Nothing, thanks.
2	line	Willow	Hurry up! It's not exactly exciting standing out here all day.
