0	section	Checkal the strongman
0	section	Talking to Checkal
1	line	Player	Hello there. I'm {player} and I'm looking for a man named Checkal.
1	line	Checkal	That would be me [sir/miss]. What can I do for you?
1	line	Player	I was told to come find you. Willow has found a new digsi...
1	line	Checkal	Stop right there [sir/miss]. You can tell Willow she can do the heavy lifting herself.
1	line	Player	And why is that?
1	line	Checkal	Willow does not appreciate the amount of work that goes into building my physique. I would not help her lift a shrimp.
1	line	Checkal	I take great pride in these muscles and it hurts me to the core to hear such insults!
1	line	Player	But we need your help! She's found a new archaeological digsite and needs you to help clear the entrance.
1	line	Checkal	Archaeological digsite? Why is Willow interested in starting a digsite?
1	line	Player	She said there could be some ancient ruins, even an untouched hoard of gold and treasure!
1	line	Checkal	Ah that makes sense. *Sighs* You poor [lad/lass]...
1	line	Player	What do you mean?
1	line	Checkal	Nothing. Look, I will help you. But first you must prove your strength to me.
1	cond	If the player has 99 Strength:
2	line	Player	Well Checkal, I don't mean to brag, but there are few people in Gielinor stronger than me.
2	line	Checkal	Hmm... I will see about that.
2	line	Checkal	Yes... you do have tremendous muscle mass.
2	line	Checkal	Your legs are strong as steel, too.
2	line	Checkal	Well {player}, I have to say you are the definition of strength.
2	line	Player	I do try.
2	line	Checkal	But a [strongman/strongwoman] doesn't stop when they reach the top. They always push themselves.
1	cond	If the player doesn't have 99 Strength:
2	line	Player	Well that shouldn't be too hard. I'm pretty strong.
2	line	Checkal	That is true. But are you strong in both body and mind?
2	line	Player	Uhm... yes?
2	line	Checkal	To be a true [strongman/strongwoman], you do not just need big muscles. No, you must have self control and an unrelenting desire to push yourself to become stronger.
2	line	Player	Oh, I'm not sure about that...
1	line	Checkal	I would ask you to train with my old friend and trainer, Atlas, one of the strongest barbarians I know. You can find him in the hall north of here.
1	line	Checkal	If you can survive his rigorous training program, I shall offer you my help.
1	line	Player	How do you know he'll train me?
1	line	Checkal	Tell him I sent you and he will train you.
1	line	Player	Alright then, I'll go speak to Atlas. Farewell.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Checkal again
1	line	Player	I seem to have forgotten where Atlas is. Can you remind me?
1	line	Checkal	Atlas can be found in the hall to the north of us.
1	line	Player	Thanks.
1	line	Checkal	No problem at all.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Atlas
1	line	Atlas	What do you want, little [man/woman]?
1	line	Player	I've just come to talk to you. Checkal said you could train me. He said you're the strongest barbarian he knows.
1	line	Atlas	Oh did he now? What makes you think I will train you?
1	line	Player	I... Um...
1	line	Atlas	Come on then! Out with it already!
1	line	Player	Well uh, he said he wouldn't...
1	line	Atlas	I'm just pulling your leg! Any friend of Checkal is a friend of mine.
1	line	Player	Please don't scare me like that.
1	line	Atlas	It's a force of habit. It comes with the barbarian lifestyle. But to apologise, I'll give you a free lesson!
1	line	Player	Oh really? How much would this usually cost?
1	line	Atlas	Around 25,000 coins per session.
1	line	Player	That's a lot of money!
1	line	Atlas	No price is too much for a good workout. Are you ready to start your training session?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Atlas	If you want to become a [strongman/strongwoman], you need to get into shape!
2	line	Atlas	It's not all about strength! You need to get some cardio in, too.
2	line	Atlas	You need to be tough to be a [strongman/strongwoman]! Show me what you've got! Come on!
2	line	Atlas	Every [strongman/strongwoman] was once a beginner who refused to give up.
2	line	Atlas	You need to push yourself!
2	line	Atlas	Always strive to be the best that you can be! That is the [strongman/strongwoman] way.
2	line	Atlas	I'm very proud of you. You've shown grit, determination and an iron will. You are a true [strongman/strongwoman] at heart.
2	line	Player	That was exhausting... I've never worked so hard in my life!
2	line	Atlas	And for that, I am proud. Now, show us what you're made of and flex those muscles!
2	action	You have unlocked the flex emote!
2	line	Atlas	My work is done. Return to Checkal and show him your new-found muscles.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	Not right now, I am a bit busy.
2	line	Atlas	No problem. Come back when you are ready.
2	action	end
