2	line	Charlie the Tramp	Ah Marley, my cousin. He's always getting himself into trouble!
2	line	Player	Oh really? Do you know where I could find him?
2	line	Charlie the Tramp	Hmm... it's been a while since I've seen him. Last I heard he got caught in the middle of a robbery and had to flee Varrock.
2	line	Charlie the Tramp	Something to do with trying to steal a set of Wizard robes from the museum.
2	line	Player	Great, so I'm dealing with a criminal!
2	line	Charlie the Tramp	Afraid so. Marley is no stranger to the authorities... Knowing him, he's probably hanging out in Edgeville ruins till the attention dies down. I'd try there.
2	line	Player	Perfect. I'll go look for him.
