0	section	Talking to Marley
1	line	Player	Hey there. Would you happen to be Marley?
1	line	Marley	I could be. Depends on who's asking? If you're with the Varrock City Guard, I had nothing to do with the robbery at the museum. I don't even know what I'd do with some Wizard robes.
1	line	Player	Uhm, no? What robbery? Wizard robes?
1	line	Marley	Robbery? Sorry [sir/miss], first I've heard of a robbery.
1	line	Player	Look, I'm not here with the city guard, Willow sent me to find you. She needs your help.
1	line	Marley	Willow? Hmm... I'm afraid I don't recall a Willow.
1	line	Player	Are you sure? She said you were old pals.
1	line	Marley	Nope, I'm sure. Only Willow I know of is a type of tree.
1	line	Marley	But, then again, my memory is a bit hazy, due to how hungry I am.
1	line	Player	You're too hungry... to remember your friend?
1	line	Marley	Yep... been a while since I had a nice hot meal.
1	line	Player	*Sighs*... would you like me to get you something to eat, to help jog your memory?
1	line	Marley	Oh what a kind offer! I couldn't say no.
1	line	Player	Fine, I'll be back in a...
1	line	Marley	Woah woah woah, hold your horses there friend! I can't just eat anything. I have very specific dietary requirements.
1	line	Player	...
1	line	Marley	Don't be like that! I don't want nothing fancy, just a Steak sandwich from the Blue Moon Inn, in Varrock.
1	line	Player	Why don't you go and get one then?
1	line	Marley	Slight problem there, friend. I've been barred and the chef won't make me another one. Something about stealing from punters. I can't remember...
1	line	Player	*Sighs*... Fine. If I go get you this sandwich, will you help Willow?
1	line	Marley	Of course! Oh, by the way, don't bother with the bartender. Just talk to the chef. Trust me.
1	line	Player	Alright. I'll be back momentarily with your sandwich.
1	action	end
