2	line	Bartender	MARLEY?! Don't talk about that sorry state of a person in this establishment!
2	line	Player	Woah okay, sorry! Forget I ever mentioned him.
2	line	Bartender	You'd better clear off before I make you.
0	section	Talking to the Cook
1	line	Cook	What do you want? I'm busy!
1	option	I was wondering if you'd be able to make me a Steak sandwich?
2	line	Player	I was wondering if you'd be able to make me a Steak sandwich?
2	line	Cook	Hmm... we don't get many food orders in 'ere. Last person to order one of them was barred for thievin'.
2	line	Player	Oh... uhm... no. It's for me?
2	line	Cook	Really?
2	line	Player	No... it's for Marley...
2	line	Cook	I knew it! I'm not making another meal for that thievin' git! Clear off.
2	line	Player	At least tell me why you hate him so much?
2	line	Cook	I know what it's like, not knowin' where your next meals going to come from, so I let him eat 'ere for free.
2	line	Cook	The minute I turn my back, he's caught red-handed trying to pickpocket one of our patrons. We gave him the boot there 'n' then.
2	line	Player	Well, fair enough, but it's just one sandwich. He's not even in Varrock anymore. He's moved off to Edgeville.
2	line	Cook	No chance mate, it's the principle. I won't make food for such a low class criminal...
2	line	Player	Please, I really need Marley's help and he'll only offer it if I get him a Steak sandwich.
2	line	Cook	Well, I suppose if I give you the recipe, you can make it yourself.
2	line	Player	Great! I can't imagine it's that hard to make.
2	line	Cook	Watch your mouth! Making a Steak sandwich is a delicate art!
2	line	Player	Sorry! Of course it is. What's the recipe then?
2	line	Cook	To start, you need to get some prime beef from a cow. The fields around Lumbridge are a great source. Cook it up - medium rare is perfect. Don't cook it for too long or you'll burn it...
2	line	Cook	Then, you take some bread. I recommend making it fresh, but to each their own. Slice it in half and slide the beautifully cooked beef between the two halves...
2	line	Cook	And hey presto, you've got yourself a delicious, perfectly made Steak sandwich.
2	line	Player	Wow... is that it? Some beef between a loaf of bread?
2	line	Cook	It's harder to make than it sounds! Now get out before I whack you one for being so rude.
2	action	end
